silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_02_algebra_category_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "AlgebraCategoryYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_02_algebra_category_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'AlgebraCategoryYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Category of Sigma-Algebras', the forgetful_functor_arrow sends the algebra object (MittensColimitApex, colimit_alpha) to just MittensColimitApex (the carrier set); not monic because different algebras can have the same carrier (same carrier, different structure maps).; also, In 'Category of Sigma-Algebras', the free_monad_adjunction_arrow is the unit of the adjunction: eta: VetRecord_77 -> U(T_Sigma(VetRecord_77)) = T_Sigma(VetRecord_77); monic because VetRecord_77 is injected as the leaf element in all publish trees in T_Sigma(VetRecord_77)." .
